expedition-extraction-arriving = Evacuation: the expedition closes in {$minutes} min. An evacuation shuttle is flying to the drop pod landing site, coordinates: X {$x}, Y {$y}. Stay out of the landing zone, then get aboard. Anyone left behind stays on the planet.
expedition-extraction-arrived = The evacuation shuttle has arrived. Get aboard: it leaves right before the expedition ends. Anyone left behind stays on the planet.
expedition-extraction-departing = The evacuation shuttle is leaving.
